{"id": "cr-0006", "routes": [{"links": [{"surface": "محمد بن قدامة بن أعين", "start": 6, "end": 31, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "جرير", "start": 37, "end": 41, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "منصور", "start": 46, "end": 52, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "هلال بن يساف", "start": 56, "end": 68, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "أبي المثنى", "start": 72, "end": 82, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "ابن أخت، عبادة بن الصامت", "start": 86, "end": 110, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "عبادة بن الصامت", "start": 114, "end": 129, "kind": "narrator"}], "shared_tail_from": null}, {"links": [{"surface": "محمد بن سليمان الأنباري", "start": 190, "end": 214, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "وكيع", "start": 222, "end": 226, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "سفيان", "start": 230, "end": 235, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "منصور", "start": 250, "end": 256, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "هلال بن يساف", "start": 260, "end": 272, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "أبي المثنى الحمصي", "start": 276, "end": 293, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "أبي أبى ابن امرأة، عبادة بن الصامت", "start": 297, "end": 331, "kind": "narrator"}, {"surface": "عبادة بن الصامت", "start": 335, "end": 350, "kind": "narrator"}], "shared_tail_from": null}], "matn_start": 356, "notes": ["Route 1 reads «ابن أخت، عبادة بن الصامت» as one name (the nephew of Ubada), kept with the comma as written; route 2 has «أبي أبى ابن امرأة، عبادة بن الصامت», which is garbled in the text and read the same way. Each route writes منصور, هلال and أبي المثنى again, so these are separate occurrences. The editor gloss «- المعنى -» is left out. «وقال سفيان إن أدركتها معهم» after the saying is a variant wording, not a second isnad."]}
